label Greeting
KuyaKap: Oy, Manang Ana! Look at this. The old sari-sari shop is open again.
ManangAna: Is it? I thought Uncle Mario finally gave up on this place.
KuyaKap: It looks like he found someone to help him out. [pause=0.4] See? There's a new face behind the counter.
ManangAna: [i]Sus[/i], it's still so small. I hope they have the good vinegar I like.
KuyaKap: Be nice, Ana. It's their first day. 
ManangAna: I am being nice! I'm giving them my expert opinion. 
[end_timeline]
